    <text>
        <body>
            <div>
                <head>Translated parts</head>
                <p xml:id="KR6q0610-start">
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0106-s015" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-04-23T10:26:06.913+09:00">Where does the monk speak for someone?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0106-s016" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-04-23T10:26:06.913+09:00">Huang said,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0106-s017" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-04-23T10:26:06.913+09:00">"If you don't understand clearly,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0106-s018" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-04-23T10:26:06.913+09:00">then I will put my palms together."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0106-s019" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-04-23T10:26:06.913+09:00">"When I sit,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0106-s020" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-04-23T10:26:06.913+09:00">you stand in attendance."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0106-s021" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-04-23T10:26:06.913+09:00">"If you bring tea,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0106-s022" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-04-23T10:26:06.913+09:00">I will receive it for you."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0106-s023" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-04-23T10:26:06.913+09:00">The master was silent for a long time.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0106-s024" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-04-23T10:26:06.913+09:00">Huang said,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0106-s025" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-04-23T10:26:06.913+09:00">"Seeing is seeing;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0106-s026" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-04-23T10:26:06.913+09:00">to contemplate is to err."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0106-s027" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-04-23T10:26:06.913+09:00">The master then had a great awakening.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0107-h001" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-04-23T10:26:06.913+09:00">107</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0107-s002" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-04-23T10:26:06.913+09:00">Great Master Yunmen said,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0107-s003" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-04-23T10:26:06.913+09:00">"If the light does not penetrate completely,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0107-s004" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-04-23T10:26:06.913+09:00">there are two kinds of illnesses.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0107-s005" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-04-23T10:26:06.913+09:00">Not being clear in all places,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0107-s006" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-04-23T10:26:06.913+09:00">and having something in front of you, is one."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0107-s007" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-04-23T10:26:06.913+09:00">"Even if you penetrate the emptiness of all dharmas,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0107-s008" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-04-23T10:26:06.913+09:00">and there seems to be something faintly similar,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0107-s009" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-04-23T10:26:06.913+09:00">that is also a case of the light not penetrating completely."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0107-s010" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-04-23T10:26:06.913+09:00">"Furthermore, the Dharmakaya also has two kinds of illnesses.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0107-s011" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-04-23T10:26:06.913+09:00">Attaining the Dharmakaya,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0107-s012" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-04-23T10:26:06.913+09:00">and not forgetting attachment to the Dharma,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0107-s013" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-04-23T10:26:06.913+09:00">and still having one's own views,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0107-s014" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-04-23T10:26:06.913+09:00">is one: falling on the side of the Dharmakaya."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0107-s015" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-04-23T10:26:06.913+09:00">"Even if you penetrate it thoroughly,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0107-s016" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-04-23T10:26:06.913+09:00">it is impermissible to let it go."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0107-s017" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-04-23T10:26:06.913+09:00">"If you carefully examine it,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0107-s018" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-04-23T10:26:06.913+09:00">having any trace of breath is also an illness."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0108-h001" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-04-23T10:26:06.913+09:00">108</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0108-s002" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-04-23T10:26:06.913+09:00">Mazu,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0108-s003" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-04-23T10:26:06.913+09:00">because a monk asked,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0090-s120" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-04-25T16:45:46.941+09:00">Having spoken, he kicked over the boat,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0090-s121" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-04-25T16:45:46.941+09:00">and disappeared into the mist and waves.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0091-h001" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-04-25T16:45:46.941+09:00">91</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0091-s002" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-04-25T16:45:46.941+09:00">Huangbo, addressing the assembly, said,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0091-s003" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-04-25T16:45:46.941+09:00">"All the old masters of other places</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0091-s004" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-04-25T16:45:46.941+09:00">are all on the top of my staff."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0091-s005" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-04-25T16:45:46.941+09:00">A monk bowed.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0091-s006" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-04-25T16:45:46.941+09:00">Later, arriving at the place of Great Tree,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0091-s007" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-04-25T16:45:46.941+09:00">he raised the previous story.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0091-s008" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-04-25T16:45:46.941+09:00">Great Tree said,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0091-s009" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-04-25T16:45:46.941+09:00">"Huangbo said that,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0091-s010" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-04-25T16:45:46.941+09:00">has he ever actually seen the other places or not?"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0091-s011" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-04-25T16:45:46.941+09:00">The monk returned and spoke of Huangbo.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0091-s012" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-04-25T16:45:46.941+09:00">Huangbo said,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0091-s013" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-04-25T16:45:46.941+09:00">"My words have already spread throughout the world."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0091-s014" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-04-25T16:45:46.941+09:00">Langye Jue said,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0091-s015" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-04-25T16:45:46.941+09:00">"Great Tree's saying that</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0091-s016" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-04-25T16:45:46.941+09:00">is too much like having eyes but being blind."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0091-s017" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-04-25T16:45:46.941+09:00">Huangbo's one staff,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0091-s018" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-04-25T16:45:46.941+09:00">the people of the world chew on it but cannot break it.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0092-h001" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-04-25T16:45:46.941+09:00">92</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0092-s002" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-04-25T16:45:46.941+09:00">Chan Master Huiran of Three Saints Monastery,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0092-s003" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-04-25T16:45:46.941+09:00">a successor of Linji,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0092-s004" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-04-25T16:45:46.941+09:00">said,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0092-s005" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-04-25T16:45:46.941+09:00">"When I meet someone, I release it immediately;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0092-s006" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-04-25T16:45:46.941+09:00">releasing it is not for the sake of others."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0092-s007" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-04-25T16:45:46.941+09:00">Xinghua said,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0092-s008" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-04-25T16:45:46.941+09:00">"When I meet someone, I don't release it immediately;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0092-s009" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-04-25T16:45:46.941+09:00">releasing it is precisely for the sake of others."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0093-h001" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-04-25T16:45:46.941+09:00">93</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0093-s002" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-04-25T16:45:46.941+09:00">Chan Master Mi was holding a needle,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0093-s003" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-04-25T16:45:46.941+09:00">Dongshan asked,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0093-s004" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-04-25T16:45:46.941+09:00">"What are you doing?"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0093-s005" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-04-25T16:45:46.941+09:00">The Master said,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0093-s006" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-04-25T16:45:46.941+09:00">"Holding a needle."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0121-s010" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T10:37:26.452+09:00">The master went again the next day.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0121-s011" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T10:37:26.452+09:00">Gǔ had again closed himself in.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0121-s012" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T10:37:26.452+09:00">The master then knocked on the door.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0121-s013" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T10:37:26.452+09:00">Gǔ then asked,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0121-s014" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T10:37:26.452+09:00">"Who is it?"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0121-s015" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T10:37:26.452+09:00">The master said,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0121-s016" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T10:37:26.452+09:00">"Liáng Suí."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0121-s017" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T10:37:26.452+09:00">Just as he said his name,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0121-s018" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T10:37:26.452+09:00">suddenly he had an awakening.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0121-s019" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T10:37:26.452+09:00">Then he said,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0121-s020" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T10:37:26.452+09:00">"Venerable monk,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0121-s021" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T10:37:26.452+09:00">don't deceive Liáng Suí.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0121-s022" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T10:37:26.452+09:00">If I hadn't come to pay respects to the venerable monk,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0121-s023" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T10:37:26.452+09:00">I almost would have been cheated my whole life by the scriptures and treatises."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0121-s024" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T10:37:26.452+09:00">After returning to his teaching place,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0121-s025" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T10:37:26.452+09:00">he began to lecture, saying,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0121-s026" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T10:37:26.452+09:00">"What you all know,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0121-s027" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T10:37:26.452+09:00">Liáng Suí knows everything.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0121-s028" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T10:37:26.452+09:00">What Liáng Suí knows,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0121-s029" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T10:37:26.452+09:00">you all do not know."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0121-s030" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T10:37:26.452+09:00">Eventually he stopped lecturing and his followers dispersed.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0122-h001" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T10:37:26.452+09:00">122</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0122-s002" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T10:37:26.452+09:00">Chan Master Xuánzé.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0122-s003" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T10:37:26.452+09:00">A successor of Fǎyǎn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0122-s004" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T10:37:26.452+09:00">While in Fǎyǎn's community,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0122-s005" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T10:37:26.452+09:00">one day,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0122-s006" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T10:37:26.452+09:00">Yǎn said,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0122-s007" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T10:37:26.452+09:00">"How long have you been here?"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0122-s008" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T10:37:52.198+09:00">Shī yuē,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0122-s009" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T10:37:52.198+09:00">I have been in this monk assembly</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0122-s010" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T10:37:52.198+09:00">for three years already."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0122-s011" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T10:37:52.198+09:00">Yǎn said, "</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0122-s012" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T10:37:52.198+09:00">You are a junior student;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0122-s013" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T10:37:52.198+09:00">why don't you usually ask about things?"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0122-s014" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T10:37:52.198+09:00">The master said, "</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0122-s015" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T10:37:52.198+09:00">I dare not deceive the monk.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0122-s016" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T10:37:52.198+09:00">I was once at Qīngfēng's place</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0122-s017" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T10:37:52.198+09:00">and attained a place of ease and comfort."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0122-s018" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T10:37:52.198+09:00">Yǎn said, "</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0122-s019" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T10:37:52.198+09:00">How did you gain entry through words?"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0122-s020" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T10:37:52.198+09:00">The master said, "</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0122-s021" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T10:37:52.198+09:00">I once asked Qīngfēng,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0122-s022" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T10:37:52.198+09:00">'What is the student's self?'"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0122-s023" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T10:37:52.198+09:00">Fēng said, "</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0122-s024" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T10:37:52.198+09:00">'Bǐng and Dīng, the fire lads, come seeking fire.'"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0122-s025" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T10:37:52.198+09:00">Yǎn said, "</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0122-s026" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T10:37:52.198+09:00">Good words,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0122-s027" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T10:37:52.198+09:00">but I fear you do not understand."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0122-s028" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T10:37:52.198+09:00">The master said, "</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0122-s029" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T10:37:52.198+09:00">Bǐng and Dīng belong to fire;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0122-s030" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T10:37:52.198+09:00">(it's like) using fire to seek fire.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0122-s031" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T10:37:52.198+09:00">It's like using oneself to seek oneself."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0122-s032" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T10:37:52.198+09:00">Yǎn said, "</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0122-s033" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T10:37:52.198+09:00">I know you do not understand.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0122-s034" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T10:37:52.198+09:00">If the Buddha-dharma were like that,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0122-s035" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T10:37:52.198+09:00">it would not have reached today."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0122-s036" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T10:37:52.198+09:00">Thereupon, the master, feeling dejected, got up to leave.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0122-s037" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T10:37:52.198+09:00">But halfway, he said, "</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0122-s038" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T10:37:52.198+09:00">He is a good teacher for five hundred people.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0122-s039" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T10:37:52.198+09:00">If he says I am wrong,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0122-s040" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T10:37:52.198+09:00">he must have a strength."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0122-s041" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T10:37:52.198+09:00">So he turned back, confessed his error, and then asked,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0103-s010" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T15:15:13.334+09:00">What does Jìzi do then?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0103-s011" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T15:15:13.334+09:00">Yǎng said,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0103-s012" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T15:15:13.334+09:00">"I simply close my eyes when I'm sleepy,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0103-s013" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T15:15:13.334+09:00">and meditate when I'm energetic.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0103-s014" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T15:15:13.334+09:00">That's why I haven't spoken about it."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0103-s015" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T15:15:13.334+09:00">The Master said,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0103-s016" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T15:15:13.334+09:00">"Reaching this state is also rare."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0103-s017" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T15:15:13.334+09:00">Yǎng said,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0103-s018" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T15:15:13.334+09:00">"According to my view,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0103-s019" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T15:15:13.334+09:00">even uttering a single phrase is unacceptable."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0103-s020" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T15:15:13.334+09:00">The Master said,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0103-s021" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T15:15:13.334+09:00">"You cannot even be one person."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0103-s022" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T15:15:13.334+09:00">Yǎng said,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0103-s023" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T15:15:13.334+09:00">"All the sages from ancient times were like this."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0103-s024" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T15:15:13.334+09:00">The Master said,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0103-s025" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T15:15:13.334+09:00">"There are many people who would laugh at your kind of response."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0103-s026" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T15:15:13.334+09:00">Yǎng said,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0103-s027" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T15:15:13.334+09:00">"Those who understand enough to laugh at me are my fellow students."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0103-s028" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T15:15:13.334+09:00">The Master said,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0103-s029" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T15:15:13.334+09:00">"What is it like to stand out?"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0103-s030" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T15:15:13.334+09:00">Yǎng walked one circle around the meditation platform.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0103-s031" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T15:15:13.334+09:00">The Master said,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0103-s032" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T15:15:13.334+09:00">"Tearing apart the past and present."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0104-h001" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T15:15:13.334+09:00">104</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0104-s002" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T15:15:13.334+09:00">The monk Déshān</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0104-s003" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T15:15:13.334+09:00">made a career of lecturing on the Diamond Sutra.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0104-s004" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T15:15:13.334+09:00">Later, hearing that the Southern Zen school was flourishing,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0104-s005" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T15:15:13.334+09:00">he was at a loss as to the reason.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0104-s006" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T15:16:03.775+09:00">Thereupon, he ceased lecturing and dismissed his disciples,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0104-s007" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T15:16:03.775+09:00">carrying his commentaries and notes to travel south.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0104-s008" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T15:16:03.775+09:00">First, he arrived at Dragon Pool (Lóngtán).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0104-s009" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T15:16:03.775+09:00">Just as he stepped across the gate, he said,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0104-s010" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T15:16:03.775+09:00">"I have long admired Dragon Pool (Lóngtán),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0104-s011" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T15:16:03.775+09:00">but now that I have arrived,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0104-s012" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T15:16:03.775+09:00">the pool is nowhere to be seen,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0104-s013" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T15:16:03.775+09:00">and the dragon does not appear."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0104-s014" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T15:16:03.775+09:00">Tán said,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0104-s015" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T15:16:03.775+09:00">"You have personally arrived at Dragon Pool (Lóngtán)."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0104-s016" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T15:16:03.775+09:00">The master then bowed and withdrew.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0104-s017" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T15:16:03.775+09:00">At night, he entered the room,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0104-s018" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T15:16:03.775+09:00">standing in attendance until late.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0104-s019" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T15:16:03.775+09:00">Tán said,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0104-s020" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T15:16:03.775+09:00">"Why don't you go down?"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0104-s021" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T15:16:03.775+09:00">The master then carefully</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0104-s022" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T15:16:03.775+09:00">lifted the curtain and went out.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0104-s023" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T15:16:03.775+09:00">Seeing it was dark outside,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0104-s024" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T15:16:03.775+09:00">he returned and said,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0104-s025" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T15:16:03.775+09:00">"It is dark outside."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0104-s026" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T15:16:03.775+09:00">Tán then lit a paper candle and handed it to him.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0104-s027" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T15:16:03.775+09:00">Just as the master received it,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0104-s028" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T15:16:03.775+09:00">Tán blew it out.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0104-s029" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T15:16:03.775+09:00">The master then suddenly had a great enlightenment and bowed.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0104-s030" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T15:16:03.775+09:00">Tán said,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0104-s031" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T15:16:03.775+09:00">"What did you see that you bowed?"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0104-s032" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T15:16:03.775+09:00">The master said,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0104-s033" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T15:16:03.775+09:00">"From now on,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0104-s034" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T15:17:03.638+09:00">Furthermore, he did not doubt the tongues of all the old monks in the world.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0104-s035" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T15:17:03.638+09:00">The next day,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0104-s036" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T15:17:03.638+09:00">Lóngtán ascended the hall and said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0104-s037" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T15:17:03.638+09:00">"In this there is a hero,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0104-s038" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T15:17:03.638+09:00">whose teeth are like trees of swords,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0104-s039" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T15:17:03.638+09:00">and whose mouth is like a bowl of blood;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0104-s040" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T15:17:03.638+09:00">a single blow of the staff will not turn his head back.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0104-s041" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T15:17:03.638+09:00">In the future,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0104-s042" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T15:17:03.638+09:00">on the summit of a solitary peak,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0104-s043" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T15:17:03.638+09:00">he will establish my Way."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0104-s044" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T15:17:03.638+09:00">Thereupon, the master took a commentary on the sutras in front of the Dharma hall,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0104-s045" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T15:17:03.638+09:00">raised a torch and said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0104-s046" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T15:17:03.638+09:00">"Exhausting all subtle explanations,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0104-s047" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T15:17:03.638+09:00">is like adding a single hair to the great void;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0104-s048" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T15:17:03.638+09:00">exhausting the world's mechanisms,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0104-s049" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T15:17:03.638+09:00">is like casting a single drop into a giant ravine."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0104-s050" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T15:17:03.638+09:00">He then burned the commentary.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0104-s051" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T15:17:03.638+09:00">Thereupon, he bid farewell.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0105-h001" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T15:17:03.638+09:00">105</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0105-s002" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T15:17:03.638+09:00">Yúnyán asked Dàowú,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0105-s003" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T15:17:03.638+09:00">"What does the Bodhisattva of Great Compassion,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0105-s004" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T15:17:03.638+09:00">do with so many hands and eyes?"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0105-s005" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T15:17:03.638+09:00">Dàowú said,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0105-s006" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T15:17:03.638+09:00">"It is like a person feeling for a pillow in the dark with their hand behind their back."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0105-s007" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T15:17:03.638+09:00">Yúnyán said,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0105-s008" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T15:17:03.638+09:00">"I understand,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0105-s009" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T15:17:03.638+09:00">I understand."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0105-s010" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T15:17:03.638+09:00">Dàowú said,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0105-s011" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T15:17:03.638+09:00">"How do you understand?"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0105-s012" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T15:17:03.638+09:00">Yúnyán said,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0105-s013" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T15:17:03.638+09:00">"The entire body is hands and eyes."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0105-s014" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T15:17:03.638+09:00">Dàowú said,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0610_DZZ_0105-s015" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T15:17:03.638+09:00">"That's certainly saying it,</seg>
